@baseUrl = https://localhost:8010/camplib/v1
@accessToken = paste-reader-access-token-here
@readerId = 10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Provision current reader from IdentityAccessServer token claims
### The optional id is retained for deterministic tests and examples.
### Expected: 204 No Content
POST {{baseUrl}}/readers/me/provision?id={{readerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get current reader profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/readers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Complete the initial current reader profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/readers/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "firstname": "Alice",
  "lastname": "Reader",
  "addressDto": {
    "street": "Profilstraße 1",
    "postalCode": "29556",
    "city": "Suderburg",
    "country": "DE"
  }
}

### Change mutable current reader data after profile completion
PUT {{baseUrl}}/readers/me/update
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "lastname": "Changed",
  "email": "alice.changed@example.org",
  "addressDto": {
    "street": "Neue Straße 7",
    "postalCode": "29556",
    "city": "Suderburg",
    "country": "DE"
  }
}
